// Signing configuration.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM is deliberately not committed: it identifies an Apple
// developer account, and this repository is public. Put your own team in a
// Local.xcconfig beside this file, which Git ignores:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
//
// Without it, Xcode builds until it needs to sign, then asks you to pick a
// team in Signing & Capabilities. Beware: choosing one there writes the value
// back into the project file, so move it here and undo that change.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
